	"description": "<blockquote>An Arcane Warrior Wielding Spell and Steel…</blockquote><p>The Magus is a spell-slinging, steel-wielding new class with six subclasses, perfect for mixing and matching magical themes and combat styles.</p><p>New Features:</p><ul><li>The Magus class</li><li><strong>6 subclasses:</strong> Arcane Order, Heaven’s Guard, Knights Stygian, Shadow Court, Sidereal Cabal, Sylvan Circle.</li><li><strong>30+ new spells</strong> available to the Magus and expanding the spell lists of other classes.</li><li><strong>20 magic items</strong> every aspiring gish will wish for.</li></ul>",
